    "title": "Somerville slips past Nottingham to snap skid - Boys soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n1 hours ago Mathias Gonzalez scored a pair of goals as Somerville edged Nottingham 4-3 in Hamilton to end a four-game losing streak. Benny Martinez and Noah Gad also scored and Denis Music had two assists for the Pioneers (3-8). Herbert Addo netted two goals for Nottingham (3-7). If you purchase a product... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
